  titleText: {fileID: 763979139}
  infoText: {fileID: 1181849424}
  infoImageRenderer: {fileID: 1366732399}
  modelDescriptions:
  - A healthy spine model.
  - A fractured spine model. See if you can spot the indent on the front of the spine.
  - A scoliosis spine model. Notice the curvature of the spine.
  - A Spondylolisthesis spine. See if you can spot the slight jutting out of the
    bone section.
  - A degenerated disc model. See if you can spot the affected disc.
  - A spine with arthritis. Notice the rough edges on the ends of the vertebrae.
  - A kyphotic spine. The upper back portion of affected spines often have an unnatural
    hunch.
  modelTitles:
  - Healthy Spine
  - Fractured
  - Scoliosis
  - Spondylolisthesis
  - Degenerated Disc
  - Arthritis
  - Kyphosis
